// Title: SC.EXE Query Execution
// Rule ID: 57712d7a-679c-4a41-a913-87e7175ae429
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1007, detection.threat-hunting
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules-threat-hunting/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_sc_query.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
